### Description

File src/Illuminate/Http/Client/Factory.php, method psr7Response().
https://github.com/laravel/framework/commit/db427e6f240c60f2a2f5238156462ea8562c4ef9#diff-7e12e819391f6a1bb91c168b6c563f50211ef1c84944dcdbabbe0dbb2a2d94b0R192-R194
There is new condition
```
if (! is_string($body) && ! is_null($body)) {
  throw new InvalidArgumentException('HTTP fake response body must be a string, array, or null.');
}
```
This condition causes exception for body of StreamInterface type.
Guzzle Response accepts StreamInterface.
https://github.com/guzzle/psr7/blob/2.12/src/Response.php

